"隐私说明" = "Privacy Disclosure";
"隐私政策" = "Privacy Policy";
"请在首次使用隧道前了解 AuraTunnel 如何处理网络数据。" = "Understand how AuraTunnel handles network data before first using the tunnel.";
"开发者不收集 VPN 流量" = "The Developer Does Not Collect VPN Traffic";
"AuraTunnel 的开发者不收集、记录、出售或用于分析你的浏览历史、DNS 查询、流量内容、源 IP、目的地址或连接日志。App 不包含账号、广告、埋点或第三方分析 SDK。" = "AuraTunnel's developer does not collect, log, sell, or analyze your browsing history, DNS queries, traffic content, source IP, destination addresses, or connection logs. The app has no accounts, ads, telemetry, or third-party analytics SDKs.";
"流量只为完成你选择的连接而转发" = "Traffic Is Forwarded Only for the Connection You Choose";
"Packet Tunnel 会在设备上实时处理流量，并将需要代理的流量发往你导入并选择的节点；直连流量发往目标网站或服务。开发者不提供、控制或接收你导入的第三方节点数据。节点运营方和目标服务可能按各自政策处理网络数据，请只使用你信任的节点。" = "Packet Tunnel processes traffic in real time on the device. Proxied traffic goes to the node you import and select; direct traffic goes to its destination. The developer does not provide, control, or receive data from your imported third-party nodes. Node operators and destination services may process network data under their own policies, so use only nodes you trust.";
"配置保存在你的设备上" = "Configuration Stays on Your Device";
"节点和订阅认证信息保存在共享 Keychain，规则与运行状态保存在 App Group。你主动导出的备份会包含节点认证信息，并由你选择保存位置；AuraTunnel 不会自动上传备份。" = "Node and subscription credentials are stored in the shared Keychain; rules and runtime state are stored in the App Group. Backups you export contain node credentials and are saved where you choose. AuraTunnel never uploads backups automatically.";
"相机和剪贴板仅由你触发" = "Camera and Clipboard Are User-Initiated";
"只有点击扫码后才会请求相机权限，画面仅用于实时二维码识别，不保存或上传。剪贴板只在你点击系统“粘贴”按钮后读取；复制节点时只执行你选择的写入操作。" = "Camera access is requested only after you choose Scan. Frames are used for live QR recognition and are never stored or uploaded. Clipboard content is read only after you tap the system Paste button; copying a node only performs the write action you choose.";
"继续即表示你已阅读这份数据处理说明。它不是系统权限授权；相机和 VPN 配置仍会在你实际使用对应功能时由 iOS 单独询问。" = "Continuing confirms that you have read this disclosure. It does not grant a system permission; iOS asks separately when you use camera or VPN configuration features.";
"我已了解并继续" = "I Understand and Continue";
"进入 AuraTunnel，不会在此处请求系统权限" = "Enter AuraTunnel; no system permission is requested here";
"立即切换本页和 App 的显示语言" = "Immediately change the language used on this page and in the app";
"购买、删除与联系" = "Purchase, Deletion & Contact";
"AuraTunnel 仅为 App Store 付费下载，不含 App 内购买。你可以在节点库删除节点或订阅、删除导出的备份，并通过删除 App 清除容器数据。开发者没有用户账号或服务器端用户数据库。" = "AuraTunnel is a paid App Store download with no in-app purchases. You can delete nodes or subscriptions in Nodes, remove exported backups, and delete the app to clear its container data. The developer has no user accounts or server-side user database.";
